{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "Maps each landmark kind in floorplan.json to models. 'polyhaven' parts are downloaded by tools/fetch_models.py and normalised in Blender by tools/blender/normalize_model.py. 'blender' parts are built by tools/blender/build_props.py. Offsets are in the landmark's local frame (x right, z forward, metres, yaw degrees about +y), before the landmark yaw is applied. 'fit' scales a model uniformly so its largest horizontal extent or its height matches the number given.",
